1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,533
[GASPS] Pervert!
Pervert! [SCREAMS]

2
00:00:02,533 --> 00:00:04,100
(In Korean) Stop that!

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,767
You pervert! [WHIMPERS]

4
00:00:05,767 --> 00:00:09,000
[CRIES] Oh, my god!

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
You! You go!

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,133
You stay away!

7
00:00:12,133 --> 00:00:14,600
Just because you're a VIP,
doesn't mean you can...

8
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:16,667
touch my body!

9
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:18,367
No, no, no, no!

10
00:00:18,367 --> 00:00:19,767
What are you talking about?

11
00:00:19,767 --> 00:00:22,700
[SCOFFS] You don't know?
Do you have amnesia?

12
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,400
A while ago, you...

13
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:27,467
[CLAPPING] You're doing this!

14
00:00:27,467 --> 00:00:30,000
I could feel it!

15
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,033
I felt it!

16
00:00:31,033 --> 00:00:32,167
[HANNAH GROANS]

17
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:36,300
My purity... [CRIES]

18
00:00:36,333 --> 00:00:37,533
You mean this?

19
00:00:39,167 --> 00:00:44,800
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

20
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:47,500
[LAUGHS AWKWARDLY]

21
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:50,567
How embarrassing!

22
00:00:50,567 --> 00:00:53,667
This is what I get
for overreacting.

23
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,433
I think someone
owes me an apology.

24
00:01:00,433 --> 00:01:06,167
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

25
00:01:06,167 --> 00:01:09,033
[STAMMERS] Sir...
(In Korean) I'm sorry.

26
00:01:09,067 --> 00:01:10,233
I'm really sorry.

27
00:01:10,667 --> 00:01:12,533
I'm just looking for...

28
00:01:13,533 --> 00:01:14,767
for my shoe.

29
00:01:14,767 --> 00:01:17,100
Because you threw it in here,
remember?

30
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:18,400
We'll get you a new one.

31
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:21,233
(In Korean) Thank you.

32
00:01:24,167 --> 00:01:25,833
Uh... I'll go.

33
00:01:25,833 --> 00:01:28,233
[GIGGLING AWKWARDLY]

34
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:32,100
I really hate this place.

35
00:01:36,567 --> 00:01:43,533
[INTRIGUING MUSIC PLAYING]

36
00:01:50,567 --> 00:01:52,300
[CHAIRMAN SONG] (In Korean)
<i> Just find the necklace.</i>

37
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:55,233
<i>It will lead you
to my daughter.</i>

38
00:01:55,233 --> 00:02:01,833
[INTRIGUING MUSIC CONTINUES]
